95
00:05:49,290 --> 00:05:50,290
Did you actually see it?

96
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:51,990
Why do you see me in such a bad light?

97
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,030
Nine,

98
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:53,970
you can fool

99
00:05:53,990 --> 00:05:55,190
anyone in this world,

100
00:05:55,409 --> 00:05:56,350
but it won't be me.

101
00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:57,630
I can see through you.

102
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:59,100
Even Third caught on.

103
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,390
If you're gonna act all cute and innocent,

104
00:06:01,410 --> 00:06:03,280
do it with someone else, not me.

105
00:06:05,350 --> 00:06:07,090
Don't fucking get mad at me.

106
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:08,400
If something happens to you,

107
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:09,690
