116
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:29,900
Sorry, Mama...

117
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:31,600
I just snapped.

118
00:06:32,570 --> 00:06:33,400
You...

119
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:35,400
