Next time, give me a heads-up.

121
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:40,100
I'll always be on your side.

122
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,280
What are you afraid of?

123
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:42,890
Got it?

124
00:06:56,970 --> 00:06:59,560
[Reading the script]
[All day, every day]

125
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,350
