156
00:08:35,230 --> 00:08:36,820
Well, he was cramping.

157
00:08:37,750 --> 00:08:39,549
He really was!

158
00:08:39,990 --> 00:08:41,370
Hey, I already told you

159
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,340
