167
00:08:56,700 --> 00:08:58,160
Einstein himself, aren't you?!

168
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,390
I'm gonna block you!

169
00:09:00,010 --> 00:09:01,110
Unbelievable.

170
00:09:01,460 --> 00:09:02,770
You have low EQ, too.

171
00:09:03,890 --> 00:09:05,000
Stop talking about...

172
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:07,350
EQ and IQ already, you dumbass!

173
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:09,580
Huh?

174
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,240
What did you just say?

175
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,780
You dumbass! Dumbass! Dumbass!

176
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,570
Dumbass! Dumbass! Dumbass!

177
00:09:12,590 --> 00:09:13,540
You dumbass! You dumbass!

178
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,200
You dumbass!!

179
00:09:15,190 --> 00:09:15,840
Ugh!

180
00:09:16,370 --> 00:09:17,050
