181
00:09:17,690 --> 00:09:18,490
Damn it!

182
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:19,790
Shouldn't have called that jerk!

183
00:09:19,810 --> 00:09:21,000
Shut up! Bastard!

184
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,600
I can't focus on my homework!

185
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:26,630
I'm sorry!

186
00:09:27,690 --> 00:09:28,900
