190
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:52,910
Hello, Cher.

191
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,370
Hello, Nine.

192
00:09:54,390 --> 00:09:55,390
Hi, Wan.

193
00:09:55,830 --> 00:09:57,210
Nine, are you waiting for Sunny?

194
00:09:57,230 --> 00:09:58,300
Wanna walk to the dressing room with us?

195
00:09:58,950 --> 00:09:59,900
Oh...

196
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,780
- So, like...
- He's good.

197
00:10:04,690 --> 00:10:06,220
