201
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:16,430
Let's go, sweetie.

202
00:10:17,130 --> 00:10:18,680
We have a VIP room.

203
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:20,480
A sky loft, that is.

204
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:29,000
They have a sky loft as a makeup room?

205
00:10:30,710 --> 00:10:31,790
Don't get confused.

206
00:10:31,830 --> 00:10:33,240
That's showbiz for you.

207
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:34,480
Start learning today.

208
00:10:34,980 --> 00:10:36,310
We should go, too. Come on.

209
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,280
Alright.

210
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:42,290
Sky,

211
00:10:42,990 --> 00:10:44,180
I need to talk to you.

212
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,700
So now you wanna talk?

213
00:10:48,090 --> 00:10:49,510
You can do whatever.

214
00:10:50,490 --> 00:10:52,080
I'm only asking you one thing.

215
00:10:52,690 --> 00:10:53,790
Leave Noel alone.

216
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:56,900
Noel... That old...

217
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:00,710
Noel, that new boy of yours?

218
00:11:04,070 --> 00:11:05,180
I'm sorry, Pai.

219
00:11:05,490 --> 00:11:06,190
Cut!

220
00:11:06,810 --> 00:11:08,790
Wan, it's been so many takes,

221
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:10,780
and none of them work!

222
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:13,660
Luang, you're the acting coach.

223
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,280
Go help him get it right.

224
00:11:15,310 --> 00:11:17,040
What you've learned about chakra opening,

225
00:11:17,060 --> 00:11:17,620
put it to use.

226
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:20,430
Tell the scriptwriter to write
lines that come naturally to him.

227
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,480
Hold up...

228
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,810
The actor can't act,

229
00:11:23,830 --> 00:11:25,400
and you're seriously
blaming the scriptwriter?

230
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:27,380
How are they supposed to do that?

231
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,590
Give the script legs

232
00:11:28,610 --> 00:11:29,970
and have it run out of his mouth?!

233
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,520
Yeah, aren't we supposed to be a team?!

234
00:11:31,540 --> 00:11:32,100
Huh?

235
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:34,200
And the actor needs to learn
to fend for himself!

236
00:11:34,450 --> 00:11:36,210
You asked if I could help him act?

237
00:11:36,230 --> 00:11:37,050
Sure, I can.

238
00:11:37,070 --> 00:11:39,400
But his brain and his memory can't!

239
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:40,900
Cannot, okay?

240
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:41,920
- Let's take a break, then!
- Haven't I told you

241
00:11:41,940 --> 00:11:43,570
to recast him from the start?

242
00:11:43,590 --> 00:11:44,270
Taking a break!

243
00:11:44,290 --> 00:11:45,360
Fine, do that!

244
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:48,130
After this, he needs to pull this off!

245
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,680
And the person who'll make that happen

246
00:11:50,970 --> 00:11:52,030
is the acting coach.

247
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:53,950
I'm not fucking doing that!

248
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:56,120
Do it yourself if you're so good!

249
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:57,080
Bitch...

250
00:11:57,590 --> 00:11:59,310
Why the fuck did we hire an acting coach?!

251
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:01,670
Alright, guys...

252
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:03,200
Let's take a break.

253
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:04,200
Come on, go take a break.

254
00:12:04,220 --> 00:12:05,440
Hurry, go take your break.

255
00:12:05,460 --> 00:12:06,920
Be back at 11:30.

256
00:12:06,940 --> 00:12:08,570
Quick, chop-chop!

257
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:09,630
Damn it, go!

258
00:12:10,090 --> 00:12:11,780
Boy, go memorize your lines!

259
00:12:13,740 --> 00:12:14,500
Come on.

260
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:25,070
The stuff I have to deal with each day.

261
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:26,710
As if that boy can act. Did you see it?

262
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:28,470
15 takes, are you nuts?

263
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:28,960
Ugh!

264
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:30,190
Let's gulp down 10 coffees.

265
00:12:30,210 --> 00:12:31,250
Mama,

266
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:34,120
I'd like a latte, no sweet, oat milk,

267
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:35,090
and make it a double shot.

268
00:12:35,110 --> 00:12:37,120
And one orange juice, Mom.

269
00:12:37,150 --> 00:12:39,280
Thank you, Kateyki.

270
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:42,900
This morning's coffee didn't
even get to say hi to my stomach.

271
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:44,650
Anyone can tell he can't act.

272
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:46,160
How did he get past the casting team?

273
00:12:46,460 --> 00:12:47,940
There's always one troublemaker on set.

274
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:48,560
Get the pic?

275
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:49,380
Except for you and me, though.

276
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,400
Not us.

277
00:12:50,420 --> 00:12:52,890
Walls have ears, y'all.

278
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,490
Exactly.

279
00:12:53,510 --> 00:12:56,080
So be careful when you gossip, yeah?

280
00:12:56,130 --> 00:12:57,450
Mm...

281
00:12:57,470 --> 00:12:58,380
